<div class="card bg-dark mb-4 mt-4" id="faq">
	<div class="card-header custom-header text-center">
		<h3>
			<i class="fas fa-question-circle"></i> Common Issues & Solutions
			(FAQs)
		</h3>
	</div>
	<div class="card-body">
		<div class="faq-item">
			<h5 class="highlight "><b>Login Issues</b></h5>
			<p>
				<strong>Problem:</strong> Unable to log in to your account
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong>Solutions:</strong>
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Ensure you're using the correct email address and password
				</li>
				<li>Check if Caps Lock is enabled on your keyboard</li>
				<li>Clear your browser cache and cookies</li>
				<li>Use the "Forgot Password" link to reset your credentials</li>
				<li>Try accessing from a different browser or device</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div class="faq-item">
			<h5 class="highlight font-weight-bold"><b>Payment Not Processed</b></h5>
			<p>
				<strong>Problem:</strong> Payment fails or shows pending status
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong>Solutions:</strong>
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Verify your card has sufficient funds and isn't expired</li>
				<li>Check if your bank is blocking the transaction (common for
					new online services)</li>
				<li>Ensure your billing address matches your card information</li>
				<li>Wait 10-15 minutes as some transactions may be delayed</li>
				<li>Try an alternative payment method if available</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div class="faq-item">
			<h5 class="highlight font-weight-bold"><b>Slot Not Available</b></h5>
			<p>
				<strong>Problem:</strong> Unable to find available parking slots
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong>Solutions:</strong>
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Refresh the page to get the latest availability</li>
				<li>Try different time slots or nearby locations</li>
				<li>Check for any system maintenance notifications</li>
				<li>For popular locations, book at least 24 hours in advance</li>
				<li>Enable notifications for slot availability alerts</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div class="faq-item">
			<h5 class="highlight font-weight-bold"><b>QR Code Not Scanning</b></h5>
			<p>
				<strong>Problem:</strong> Entry/exit barriers don't recognize your
				QR code
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong>Solutions:</strong>
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Increase your screen brightness to maximum</li>
				<li>Remove any screen protector that might be affecting the
					scan</li>
				<li>Ensure the QR code is fully visible and not cropped</li>
				<li>Try downloading the QR code as an image instead of viewing
					in email</li>
				<li>Contact on-site staff for manual verification if needed</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div class="faq-item">
			<h5 class="highlight"><b>Booking Confirmation Delay</b></h5>
			<p>
				<strong>Problem:</strong> No confirmation email received after
				booking
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong>Solutions:</strong>
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Check your spam or junk folder</li>
				<li>Verify the email address in your profile is correct</li>
				<li>Wait up to 15 minutes as emails may be delayed</li>
				<li>Check your booking status in your account dashboard</li>
				<li>Contact support if confirmation doesn't arrive after 30
					minutes</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>